lay: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Tia6593icv0lvf4dHREGOfbmAfP622IA0ctib7XLruCiaic1fylcq16UlTRsAfTqJ7ic2yrts31yszWxsw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          图片来源\n         </span>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.cafeimports.com/europe/ecuador\" style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;outline: 0px;cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\" wah-hotarea=\"click\">\n          CAFE IMPORT\n         </a>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           Zamora Chinchipe\n          </span>\n          位于地图上南部，Loja省右边\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n           关于养豆、储存和冲煮\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于 珍藏庄园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<hr style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);border-right-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0px 0px;'/>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          珍藏庄园位于厄瓜多尔南部Zamora chinchipe省，庄园项目开始于2018年，此前这片土地是David（庄园主儿子，现在庄园负责人之一）祖父的土地，1940年，他们在这里扎根，种植蔬菜等农产品、也有咖啡。当他们再次回到祖父留下这片土地的时候，决定保留爷爷当年种下的一些树木、同时曾经未进行过耕种的森林也依然决定保留、不做更多的开垦。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SR9xz1aMKg8q8OicuvPONX4nlFiagy7HM2Bn6G8CIHdNSlXcUliaFWb5e6G3Le62MWy1kVxzQAD0Qrg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          因为庄园周围有5个厄瓜多尔国家公园保护区（Tapichalaca, Podocarpus, Cerro plateado, Yacuri, Jocotoco），这里有独特的气候、环境、厄瓜多尔的特殊动植物物种，所以以reserva命名。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2023年，庄园第一次参与COE，即获得13名的成绩。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SR9xz1aMKg8q8OicuvPONX4UxlsQvUOrz1bRTYPk3ohIctR8jiat2vXCd53uGYKoheMFt5e4D7Nvng/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          脱皮设施在农场内，但由于农场特殊的微气候湿度较大，不利于干燥，所以干燥是在隔壁的洛哈省，车程3-4小时找了一个地方，哪里有更为干燥和相对高一些的气温；David和他的哥哥都是建筑专业毕业，所以在搭建晒床和晒棚的时候同时考虑到了地势和空气对流，可以更好的保持晒棚中的空气流动。‍‍‍‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          David现在主要负责销售，兼职做着建筑师的副业；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SR9xz1aMKg8q8OicuvPONX4YGntSr4lCiaJu3wCicH0ox6TicPL2RBhI5j1JHKZNGph9260wlaUicdIoA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          目前庄园现有品种\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          -Sidra\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          -Gesha\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          -Wushwush\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          -Typica Mejorado\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
